  "content": {
    "rendered": "<div class=\"atlas-purified-matrix\"><style>\n        :root {\n            --primary-blue: #0056b3;\n            --secondary-green: #28a745;\n            --accent-yellow: #ffc107;\n            --dark-black: #1a1a1a;\n        }\n        .hero-gradient {\n            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.7), rgba(0,0,0,0.7)), url('https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/air-handling-units.webp');\n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center;\n        }\n        .whatsapp-float {\n            position: fixed;\n            bottom: 20px;\n            right: 20px;\n            background-color: #25d366;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 15px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            z-index: 1000;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n        }\n        .section-padding { padding: 60px 0; }\n        .brand-grid img { filter: grayscale(100%); transition: 0.3s; }\n        .brand-grid img:hover { filter: grayscale(0%); }\n    </style>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Service\",\n      \"serviceType\": \"Air Handling Unit Services\",\n      \"provider\": {\n        \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n        \"name\": \"Atlas Aircon\",\n        \"image\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\",\n        \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"streetAddress\": \"Sayajigunj\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"Vadodara\",\n          \"addressRegion\": \"Gujarat\",\n          \"postalCode\": \"390005\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"IN\"\n        },\n        \"telephone\": \"+919727257141\",\n        \"priceRange\": \"₹₹\",\n        \"email\": \"atlasaircon1@gmail.com\"\n      },\n      \"areaServed\": {\n        \"@type\": \"City\",\n        \"name\": \"Vadodara\"\n      },\n      \"aggregateRating\": {\n        \"@type\": \"AggregateRating\",\n        \"ratingValue\": \"4.9\",\n        \"reviewCount\": \"1250\"\n      },\n      \"hasOfferCatalog\": {\n        \"@type\": \"OfferCatalog\",\n        \"name\": \"AHU Maintenance Services\",\n        \"itemListElement\": [\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n            \"itemOffered\": {\n              \"@type\": \"Service\",\n              \"name\": \"AHU General Service\"\n            },\n            \"price\": \"1500\",\n            \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n            \"itemOffered\": {\n              \"@type\": \"Service\",\n              \"name\": \"HEPA Filter Replacement\"\n            },\n            \"price\": \"8500\",\n            \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n    </script>\n\n\n    <!-- HEADER MENU -->\n    <header class=\"bg-white shadow-md sticky top-0 z-50\">\n        <nav class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex justify-between items-center\">\n            <a href=\"/home\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon Logo\" class=\"h-12\" title=\"\">\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:flex space-x-6 text-sm font-bold uppercase\">\n                <a href=\"/home\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Home</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">AC Service</a>\n                <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Chiller</a>\n                <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">HVAC</a>\n                <a href=\"/shop\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Shop</a>\n                <a href=\"/locations\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Locations</a>\n                <a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Contact</a>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"lg:hidden text-2xl\"><i class=\"fas fa-bars\"></i></button>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- HERO BANNER -->\n    <section class=\"hero-gradient h-[600px] flex items-center text-white relative\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-4 leading-tight\">\n                Premium <span class=\"text-yellow-400\">Air Handling Unit services Vadodara</span>\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 max-w-2xl\">\n                Atlas Aircon provides professional <b>AHU repair, installation, and AMC services</b> across industrial hubs in Gujarat. 100% genuine spares and expert technicians.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"bg-[#25d366] hover:bg-green-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold flex items-center transition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                    <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp mr-2 text-2xl\"></i> Chat on WhatsApp\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold transition\">\n                    Call: +91 97272 57141\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- INTRODUCTION SECTION (Keyword focus) -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n                <div>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">Expert <span class=\"text-blue-700\">Air Handling Unit services Vadodara</span> for Industrial Growth</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mb-4 text-lg leading-relaxed\">\n                        When looking for reliable <b>Air Handling Unit services Vadodara</b>, businesses demand precision, speed, and technical expertise. At Atlas Aircon, we specialize in the complete lifecycle of AHU systems. Whether you operate a sterile pharmaceutical cleanroom in <b>Savli GIDC</b> or a heavy manufacturing plant in <b>Makarpura Industrial Estate</b>, your indoor air quality depends on a perfectly functioning AHU.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-6\">\n                        An Air Handling Unit (AHU) is the heart of any central HVAC system. It regulates and circulates air as part of a heating, ventilating, and air-conditioning system. Our team ensures that your unit operates at peak efficiency, reducing energy costs and preventing unexpected breakdowns. We provide services for <b>Single Skin AHUs</b>, <b>Double Skin AHUs</b>, and <b>Hygienic AHUs</b> used in hospitals and chemical labs.\n                    </p>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/ahu-manufacturers-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Air Handling Unit services Vadodara\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-xl mb-6\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border-t-4 border-blue-600\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Why Choose Atlas Aircon?</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Expert Technicians:</b> Specialized in industrial HVAC systems with 15+ years of experience.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>On-Site Repair:</b> Rapid response to all <b>GIDC areas in Vadodara</b> and surrounding districts.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Original Spares:</b> We use only high-quality motors, belts, and filters for long-lasting performance.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Advanced Diagnostics:</b> Airflow testing, vibration analysis, and motor efficiency audits.</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- BRANDS WE REPAIR -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Which Brands We Repair &#038; Service</h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-10 text-gray-600\">We provide expert technical support for all leading HVAC brands available in Gujarat and across India.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-8 items-center opacity-80\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Blue Star</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Daikin</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Carrier</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Voltas</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Zeco</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Trane</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>York</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Edgetech</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Citizen</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Hitachi</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Mitsubishi</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>LG</b></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"/blue-star-ac-service-center-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\">Blue Star Services</a>\n                <a href=\"/daikin-ac-service-center-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\">Daikin Support</a>\n                <a href=\"/carrier-ac-service-center-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\">Carrier Solutions</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- TYPES WE REPAIR -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-900 text-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center\">Types of AHU We Service in Vadodara</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Horizontal AHUs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">Commonly used in large commercial spaces and malls. We handle motor alignment and coil cleaning.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-yellow-500 font-bold\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-green-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Vertical / Floor Mounted</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">Ideal for spaces with height constraints. We specialize in vibration isolation and drainage issues.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-green-500 font-bold\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-blue-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Hygienic / Pharma AHUs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">Strictly for cleanrooms. Service includes HEPA filter replacement and validation checks.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 font-bold\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- GIDC & INDUSTRIAL FOCUS SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-gray-900\">Dedicated Service for Industrial Estates &#038; GIDC Parks</h2>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg\">\n                <p class=\"mb-6 text-lg\">\n                    Vadodara is a hub for chemical, pharmaceutical, and engineering industries. Atlas Aircon offers specialized <b>Air Handling Unit services Vadodara</b> specifically tailored for the demanding environments of GIDC parks. We understand that downtime in an industrial facility can result in massive losses.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-blue-800\"><i class=\"fas fa-industry mr-2\"></i> Major GIDC Coverage</h4>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Makarpura GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Savli GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Nandesari GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Por GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Waghodia GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Manjusar GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Ranoli Industrial Estate</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Padra GIDC</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-green-800\"><i class=\"fas fa-warehouse mr-2\"></i> Industrial Parks</h4>\n                        <ul class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm\">\n                            <li>Nexus Industrial Park</li>\n                            <li>Shah Industrial Park</li>\n                            <li>Brushellz Industrial Park</li>\n                            <li>Fortune Industrial Park</li>\n                            <li>Sardar Industrial Estate</li>\n                            <li>Gokul Industrial Estate</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PRICE TABLE -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">AHU Spare Parts &#038; Service Price List 2026</h2>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white uppercase text-sm\">\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Product / Service Description</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Unit Cost (Approx)</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Buy/Service Link</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>AHU General Servicing</b> (Cleaning &#038; Inspection)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 1,500 &#8211; 3,500</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/shop\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold\">Book Service</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Pre-Filter</b> (Synthetic/Washable)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 450 &#8211; 1,200</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/pre-filter\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold\">View Product</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>HEPA Filter</b> (Pharma Grade 99.97%)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 8,500 &#8211; 35,000</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/hepa-filter\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold\">View Product</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Fan Belt Replacement</b> (Set of 3)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 850 &#8211; 2,500</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/fan-belts\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold\">View Product</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>AHU Motor Repair / Rewinding</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 4,500 &#8211; 12,000</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/fan-motor\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold\">Get Quote</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Cooling Coil Replacement</b> (DX/Chilled)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 8,500 &#8211; 75,000</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/cooling-coils\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold\">View Product</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4 italic\">* Prices are subject to change based on unit CFM capacity and brand requirements. Contact Atlas Aircon for a firm quote.</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PROS AND CONS -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-center\">Pros and Cons of Professional AHU Maintenance</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n                <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-8 border-green-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-800\">Advantages (Pros)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Extended Equipment Life:</b> Regular servicing prevents early mechanical failure of motors and bearings.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Energy Efficiency:</b> Clean coils and balanced fans reduce power consumption by up to 25%.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Improved Air Quality:</b> Professional filter cleaning removes 99% of dust and airborne allergens.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Compliance:</b> Essential for pharmaceutical and food industries to pass audit standards.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Silent Operation:</b> Lubricated bearings and tightened belts eliminate annoying noises.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Emergency Prevention:</b> Diagnostic checks catch leaks before they flood your ceiling.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Better Cooling Control:</b> Ensures consistent temperature across all office rooms.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-8 border-red-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-800\">Disadvantages of Neglect (Cons)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>High Repair Costs:</b> Neglected minor issues lead to expensive compressor or motor burnouts.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>System Downtime:</b> Sudden breakdowns stop production lines and affect business productivity.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Biological Risks:</b> Clogged drain pans become breeding grounds for mold and Legionella.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Skyrocketing Power Bills:</b> Dirty filters force the fan to work harder, consuming more electricity.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Odor Issues:</b> Microbial growth inside the unit leads to a musty smell throughout the building.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Voided Warranty:</b> Many manufacturers require service records to honor parts warranties.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Imbalanced Airflow:</b> Some areas get too cold while others remain hot due to damper issues.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ERROR CODES -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Common AHU Error Codes &#038; Solutions</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">E1: Insufficient Airflow</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Solution:</b> Check for clogged filters or closed dampers. Ensure fan motor is running.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">E4: High Discharge Pressure</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Solution:</b> Inspect cooling coils for debris. Check condenser water flow in chillers.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">E5: Motor Overload Trip</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Solution:</b> Check bearings for friction. Verify supply voltage and phase balance.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">E9: Water Full / Leakage Error</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Solution:</b> Clean the condensate drain pipe. Clear blockages in the drain pan.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">F0: Lack of Refrigerant</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Solution:</b> Check for leaks in the cooling coil. Recharge gas after fixing the leak.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">L0: Airflow Switch Failure</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Solution:</b> Inspect the differential pressure switch or air switch connection.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQS -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-center\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">1. How often should I get my AHU serviced in Vadodara?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">For industrial units in dusty environments like GIDC, we recommend monthly filter cleaning and quarterly deep servicing. Commercial units can be serviced every 3-6 months.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">2. Do you provide AHU AMC in Vadodara?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, Atlas Aircon offers Comprehensive and Non-Comprehensive AMC (Annual Maintenance Contracts) for all AHU brands in Vadodara and Gujarat.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">3. What are the signs of a failing Air Handling Unit?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Unusual grinding noises, reduced airflow from vents, water leaking from the casing, and unexpected spikes in energy bills are major warning signs.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">4. Can you replace HEPA filters in pharma cleanrooms?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Absolutely. We specialize in supply and installation of certified HEPA and ULPA filters with validation support for pharmaceutical industries.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">5. Why is my AHU making a loud squealing noise?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">This usually indicates a worn-out fan belt or dry motor bearings. Our technicians can replace belts and lubricate components on-site.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">6. Do you use genuine spare parts?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we source high-quality spares from brands like Zeco, Carrier, and Daikin to ensure system compatibility and reliability.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">7. Is emergency repair available in GIDC areas?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer priority breakdown support for industrial clients in Makarpura, Savli, and Nandesari GIDC to minimize production downtime.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">8. Can AHU servicing reduce my electricity bill?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes. Cleaning the cooling coils and ensuring the motor runs at the correct frequency can reduce energy usage by 15-30%.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">9. What areas in Vadodara do you cover?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We serve all major areas including Alkapuri, Akota, Gotri, Sayajigunj, and all industrial zones like Savli and Por.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">10. How do I book a service with Atlas Aircon?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">You can call us at +91 97272 57141 or chat with us on WhatsApp for an immediate booking.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREAS SERVED LIST -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white border-t\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">Service Locations Across Vadodara</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed overflow-y-auto max-h-40 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                Alkapuri | Akota | Sayajigunj | Raopura | Mandvi | Nyay Mandir | Lehripura | Panigate | Wadi | Fatehpura | Yakutpura | Nagarwada | Dandia Bazar | Khanderao Market | Pratapgunj | Fatehgunj | Nizampura | Chhani | Chhani Jakat Naka | Sama | Sama-Savli Road | Vemali | Karelibaug | Warasiya | Harni | Harni-Warasia Ring Road | Motnath Mahadev | Vip Road | New Vip Road | Ajwa Road | Waghodia Road | Bapod | Bakrawadi | Kishanwadi | Soma Talav | Tarsali | Kapurai | Makarpura | Makarpura GIDC | Maneja | Manjalpur | Jambuva | Vadsar | Susen | Dhamalpur | Por | Ramangamdi | Atladara | Kalali | Bill | Sun Pharma Road | Old Padra Road | Chakli Circle | Diwalipura | Vasna Road | Vasna-Bhayli Road | Bhayli | Sevasi | Gotri | Gotri-Sevasi Road | Subhanpura | Ellora Park | Race Course | Gorwa | Laxmipura | Undera | Ankhol | Sherkhi | Koyali | Bajwa | Karachiya | Refinery Road | Ranoli | Nandesari | Nandesari GIDC | Fajalpur | Sindhrot | Ampad | Mahapura | Khatamba | Sayajipura | Ankodiya | Khanpur | Tandalja | Jetalpur | Danteshwar | Lalbaug | Pratap Nagar | Vishwamitri | Mujmahuda | Akota-Dandia Bazar Bridge Area | Ghadiyali Pole | Chokshi Bazar | Moghul Wada | Baranpura | Nawapura | Madan Zampa | Salatwada | Kothi Kacheri | Jail Road | Bhutidizampa | Hathikhana | Raopura Tower | Jubelibaug | Amdupura | Bhayli Station Area | Bil-Chapad Road | Sama Puliya | Abhilasha Char Rasta | Amit Nagar | Sangam Char Rasta | Panigate Darwaza | Gajrawadi | Ramwadi | Yamuna Mill | Dhabhoi Road | Pratapnagar | Chowkhandi | Kansara Pol | Laheripura New Road | Ratanpol | Sursagar | Kirti Stambh | Rajmahal Road | Lalbaug Bridge | Vishwamitri Station Area.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-white section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-12\">\n            <div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon\" class=\"h-10 mb-6 brightness-0 invert\" title=\"\">\n                <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">Providing expert HVAC and <b>Air Handling Unit services Vadodara</b> for over a decade. Quality you can trust.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-4\">Core Services</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                    <li><a href=\"/ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white\">AC Service Vadodara</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white\">HVAC Repair</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\